      "actual_answer": "Theo tài liệu hiện hành: 1. Purpose and status. AlphaPay Compensation Bands 2026 is fictional demonstration material. It records a rule for AlphaPay dated 2026-01-01; the version status is held in the document registry. The precise entitlement or instruction appears in section L4 base salary. Staff should not infer an unstated allowance, rate, weekday, or exception from this document.\n\n2. Scope and eligibility. This document applies only to the organizational scope and employment categories recorded in its metadata. A matching topic or title does not grant access. The trusted personnel profile determines company, department, team, role, level, and employment type. A worker outside that scope should use their own authorized policy or ask the policy owner through an approved channel.\n\n3. L4 base salary. Fictional AlphaPay L4 base-salary band is 42,000,000–58,000,000 VND gross per month. This is a planning band, not an individual's pay. Only AlphaPay HR and Directors may read it. This rule is stated for the synthetic policy year shown in the metadata. When another company, department, or team publishes a more specific applicable policy, the reader must use the authorized policy with the correct authority and effective date. Similar wording in a handbook or FAQ is not a replacement for an approved policy.\n\n4. Request and approval. The employee submits any required request through the fictional internal workflow before relying on an approval. The responsible manager or designated owner checks eligibility, timing, and supporting records. An approval step does not change a numeric entitlement. The employee should retain the request identifier and the final decision for later review.\n\n5. Exceptions and unresolved questions. This document does not create exceptions by implication. If the rule lacks a necessary figure, deadline, location, or weekday, the answer is unknown from this source. Conflicting current documents of equal authority requir